Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What it means to be strong, to be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought somehow I could\Nlearn those things from Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.41,0:03:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Katie Toh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm slowing you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can go fast, but\Nit's too hard to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stinon, get your rifle and blow\Nthat horse away. Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.37,0:05:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't pull it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.53,0:05:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay sharp, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's catching up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't let him catch up to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Xenon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.61,0:06:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, he's catching up with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.97,0:06:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick up your gun and shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.41,0:06:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just distract him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.69,0:06:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then get up here and steer this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your gun and I'll shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:06:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hecate...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:06:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can use her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it, I can't shoot,\NI can't move my finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't, I can't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can, everyone can fight if they want\Nto, it's your choice, so what'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.07,0:07:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you give up or will you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's my choice, and I don't\Nwant to fight anymore, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to suffer anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I could get stronger\Nplaying this game, but I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you, but you have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come on, you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:08:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good! With all this\Nshaking around, I can't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on it's okay the shaking's\Ngonna stop in three two one now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how's he do it how can\Nhe be so calm now no it's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not that he's being calm\Nhe's giving it everything
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.69,0:08:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he fights, he goes all\Nout every time. No excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.69,0:08:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where he gets his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're like sitting ducks out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to find some cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.95,0:09:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I think I see a cave over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hide inside, we\Ncan avoid the SAT scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.59,0:09:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.37,0:09:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.81,0:09:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can dodge the scan and rest up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he just popped\Nup out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't see him on the scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must mean he's got\Nsome kind of cloaking skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a skill like that here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Invisibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a skill called\Nmetamaterial optical camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he's invisible,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sands are rough here, we'll\Nhear it crunching under his boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see his footprints, too, so he\Ncan't sneak up like he did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we'll keep\Nour eyes and ears open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think there's a chance Death\NGun was killed in that explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.07,0:11:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second before that truck blew up,\NI saw him jump off of that robot horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might have gotten dinged up, but I\Ncan't believe that blast killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.31,0:11:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he had me in his sights back at\Nthe stadium, I thought I was a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you know I was in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how'd you get to me so\Nfast from your position?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were wrong about\NJushi X being Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took one look and I knew it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was pretty obvious, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.01,0:11:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know a woman when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second I saw her, I knew\Nwe overlooked something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know what, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, even though our handle\Nsays Jushi, she calls herself Musketeer X.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, after I took out Musketeer X,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.85,0:11:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I looked over to the south and\Nsaw you lying there in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.65,0:12:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you were in trouble, so I grabbed\Nher rifle and grenades and charged in,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shooting and tossing\Nbombs as fast as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I let\Nmy guard down like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go beating yourself up over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, look, it's not like I knew\Nhe was hiding down there either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.93,0:12:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if our roles were\Nflipped, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have been the\None getting shot instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's okay, because I know\Nyou would have rescued me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.01,0:12:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you I can't believe it my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.81,0:12:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rivals trying to make me feel better he
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knows I'm weak and here yes consoling me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like I'm a kid or something I'm heading
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out for a bit you might as well kick back\Nhere and rest up while you can I wish
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.11,0:13:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could log out but I know you can't\Nnot till the tourney's over anyway Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going after Death Gun, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.99,0:13:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can take him on alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.41,0:13:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tough and he won't go down without\Ngetting off a shot or two at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.29,0:13:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it comes down to that,\NI don't know what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.39,0:13:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave you hanging like\Nthat, so it's better if I face him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.09,0:13:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you're scared of him too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.07,0:13:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it was the old me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have jumped\Nright in and fought him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if there was a\Nchance I was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.69,0:13:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These days there's\Nthings I have to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things you have to protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,virtual world, and the real one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.09,0:14:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then don't go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.85,0:14:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay here and keep low.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.89,0:14:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.31,0:14:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is going on, we can't log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.15,0:14:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But once the competition's\Nwhittled down to us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and one other player, we can suicide\Nout and let the other guy win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll end the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's one way of doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.53,0:14:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, it's not really a good option.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we just sit here and\Nwait for the tourney to end,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.37,0:14:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no telling how many other\Nplayers that guy's gonna kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are strong, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna hide, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going outside and help\Nyou take that bastard out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you been listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he shoots you, there's\Na chance you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a player, close combat's\Nmy specialty. It's not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in way more danger than me,\Nbecause he can be invisible if he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.39,0:15:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll pop up next to you and bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.25,0:15:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was scared out of my\Nmind back at the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was scared I was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was even weaker than I was five years\Nago, like a screaming, crying little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how I'm going to be for the\Nrest of my life, I'd rather be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only natural to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone who's\Nnot afraid of dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of being afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.65,0:15:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to fight alone and die alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was always supposed to die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:15:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no dying alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you die, you leave a hole in all\Nthe people whose lives you were part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And like it or not,\Nyou're part of mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I never\Nasked to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, my life's no one\Nelse's business but mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.09,0:16:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're involved in each other's lives now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how it is, then you can\Nprotect me for the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can't do anything, so\Ndon't go saying stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't your fight! It's\Nmine! Mine! You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I lose, even if I die, no\None can blame me for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna help?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.19,0:16:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna carry this burden with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:16:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna hold my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.99,0:17:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though they've got\Nblood all over them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.51,0:17:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.73,0:17:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You kill anyone today!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.69,0:17:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get me all bloody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you see yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murderer! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate your guts! I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I hate your guts...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I borrow your lap for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.17,0:18:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About five years ago, in a small town up\Nnorth, this guy tried to rob a post office.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The news said the robber died because\Nhis gun went off accidentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the truth is, I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.71,0:19:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I grabbed his gun and shot him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How old were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eleven years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And ever since then, whenever I see a gun,\NI start throwing up and then I pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.97,0:19:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I see a gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the face of the robber, the\Nway he looked right before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I get so scared. Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in this world, I\Ndon't have those problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.51,0:19:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that got me thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.43,0:19:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I can become the\Nstrongest player in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll be strong IRL too, and\Nmaybe even forget what I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but just now, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when Death Gun had me\Npinned, I was terrified,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and just like that, I\Nwasn't seen on anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.59,0:19:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the real me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared to die. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.69,0:19:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, what's worse is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:20:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,living with this fear, it's\Nso painful I'd rather be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know, if I run away from Death Gun\Nin my past, I'll end up weaker than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.99,0:20:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.19,0:20:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed someone once, too. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mentioned it once, about\Nhow I knew Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fought before when we\Nwere stuck in another game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sword Art Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm a survivor of SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.21,0:20:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so is Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And back then, he was a\Nred player in this guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.31,0:20:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They called themselves\NLaughing Coffin, Pea Cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had to be stopped,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.19,0:20:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so one day a party was formed to\Ncatch him and haul him off to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:20:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was in that party.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found out about our\Nplans and they ambushed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.85,0:21:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the middle of the chaos,\NI killed two of Laughing Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.85,0:21:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just cut them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.19,0:21:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And over time I managed to force\Nmyself to forget what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till yesterday when I ran into\Nthe guy calling himself Death Gun.
