Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.07,0:21:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's no doubt he was\Nwith Laughing Coffin that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.51,0:21:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure he was part of that ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.91,0:21:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am about as sure as\NI'll ever be he's one
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.87,0:21:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the players we took to prison that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, no matter what, I have\Nto settle things with him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.93,0:21:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in this world.
